# w.lang.en/shards/hand-morphology: plurals the rules and WordNet's exception list do not give: person and people, and
# nouns whose plural is the singular (sheep, deer, fish), and woman and the -man words WordNet forms by a rule of its own.
# sources: hand-core 1 (English, written in this repository)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: none (hand-written)

@w.lang.en.irregular.person w.lang.en.irregular singular=person plural=people core.source="hand-core 1"
